{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網絡流傳一段長約13秒的車Cam片段，事發地點位於長青公路，一輛私家車沿公路行駛期間，突然多次切線並兩度跨越影線，期間險些撞倒一名同方向行駛的電單車鐵騎士。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-14-12h18m55s467.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026FlbWjJCGpN1786681580.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-14-12h18m55s467.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">片段顯示，車Cam紀錄時間為本周二（12日）下午約2時25分，涉事私家車原本沿左側行車線行駛。當車輛駛至路口分叉位時，私家車突然向右切線並跨越影線進入中線。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-14-12h18m55s467.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026FlbWjJCGpN1786681580.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-14-12h18m55s467.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">私家車進入中線後，並未減速或保持車道，隨即再次向右切線。當時右側正好有一名電單車鐵騎士正在行駛，私家車幾乎貼近電單車車身，鐵騎士見狀被迫向右閃避，險些發生碰撞。其後，私家車司機再度向右切線，並再次跨越影線離去。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-14-12h19m02s143.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026DjjIRy7oJM1786681566.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-14-12h19m02s143.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">影片隨即引起熱議，不少網民指責涉事私家車司機駕駛態度，留言批評：「真係好痴線，一定要舉報」、「停佢牌啦」、「老危都入到」及「連 cut 影線」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-14T06:19:19.281284+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":336,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}